      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Unity Gateway routing: omnigent-talk demo services\n",
                "\n",
                "**gemini_router** splits 80/20 at random across Gemini 3.8/3.7 Flash, with a fallback to 3.5 Flash. The **router** classifies each prompt with gemini_fast, then sends code and SQL to **qwen_code** and everything else to **gemini_general**. Source: `system.ai_gateway.usage` (rows can take up to an hour)."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
